  "mainEntity": {
    "name": "Is Hiring HH Remodeling LLC the Right Choice for Kitchen Cabinet Installation?",
    "text": "Is Hiring HH Remodeling LLC the Right Choice for Kitchen Cabinet Installation?",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "Is HH Remodeling LLC the right choice for your kitchen cabinet installation?\n\nIf you want an experienced, hands-on general contractor who oversees your kitchen from start to finish, the answer is yes. HH Remodeling LLC was founded by Abraham Becerra, who personally acts as the primary contact and on-site lead for residential renovations across Aurora, Denver, and nearby communities. As a BBB Accredited Business with an A+ rating, the company focuses on quality finish carpentry, custom framing, drywall repair, and detailed interior remodeling.\n\nWhen Professional Guidance Helps:\nCabinet installation is rarely as simple as hanging boxes on a wall. Older homes across Colorado often have bowed drywall, sloping subfloors, and concealed wiring or plumbing lines that make leveling tricky. Abraham and his crew know how to handle uneven framing, shim boxes to a true line, and securely anchor heavy cabinets directly to wall studs without damaging hidden utilities. In addition, if your installation requires minor drywall patching, trim work, or trade coordination, HH Remodeling LLC manages those details directly.\n\nYou get personal accountability, clear communication, and fair pricing without juggling multiple sub-trades on your own. When you are ready to update your kitchen with dependable craftsmanship, contact Abraham Becerra at HH Remodeling LLC by calling 303-505-0866.",
      "@type": "Answer",
      "author": {
        "name": "HH Remodeling LLC",
        "@type": "Organization"
      }
    }
  }
